    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEw">II Ew</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be gerefan ðe mid ne amanige.] [Ld] ⁊ gif hit se gerefa ne amanige mid rihte on ðara manna gewitnesse, ðe him to gewitnesse getealde syndon, þonne bete mine oferhyrnesse mid CXX scll'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And if the reeve does not exact it [the fine] in accordance with the law, and in the presence of men who have been assigned to him as witnesses, he shall pay 120 shillings compensation for insubordination to me.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gyf hit se gerefa ne amanige mid rihte on ðara manna gewitnesse, ðe him to gewitnesse getealde syndon, ðonne bete mine oferhyrnesse mid CXX scyl'.</ab>
      </div>
